Rations Pedals — five VST3 stompboxes for Linux and Windows
Copyright (c) 2026 rations

The five plug-ins (Boost, Chorus, Flanger, Delay, Reverb) were lifted out of the
author's own Rations amp head, where they were the pedalboard page. Rations
Pedals itself — the VST3 integration under src/common/ and src/plugins/, the
pedal DSP under src/pedals/, the graphics stack under src/gfx/, the platform
views under src/platform/ and the tools under tools/ — is released under the MIT
Licence; see LICENSE. The third-party components it links, vendors and
