  NOT linked, and not present in this tree as a library. Two things from it are
  reproduced in src/dsp/sample.h: the DSP_SAMPLE typedef from dsp/dsp.h, and the
  four-line Catmull-Rom interpolator dsp::_CubicInterpolation from Resample.h,
