The following components are used under the zlib Licence:

  NanoSVG                   https://github.com/memononen/nanosvg
  Copyright (c) 2013-14 Mikko Mononen

  Vendored as src/gfx/nanosvg/nanosvg.h and nanosvgrast.h, the SVG rasteriser
  of the graphics stack these plug-ins inherited. The five pedal faces draw no
  vector icon -- every control on them is PNG art or text -- so nothing in the
