Reference material (not distributed, not compiled):

  The DSP in src/pedals/ is written against published analysis and against
  reference implementations that are read but not copied: Julius O. Smith III's
  *Physical Audio Signal Processing* (CCRMA) for the Chorus, Flanger, Delay and
  Reverb topologies; David Te-Mao Yeh's 2009 Stanford thesis for the Boost's
  clipper; and DaisySP (MIT), Freeverb (public domain), signalsmith-dsp (MIT)
  and chowdsp_wdf (BSD-3-Clause) as structural references. Where a file follows
  one of these, its header says so and says where the two differ. No source from
  any of them is present in this repository.
